      "message": "Can we have a much more detailed description of this feature. Everything in this patch should be mentioned. If we accept this into android common, then all partners have the right to use it and the Android kernel team has to support it.  Also describe the functions that are exposed by this patch to manage it.\n\nThe commit message must also describe *why* this needed. You don\u0027t have to disclose your private policies for how the feature is used by QCOM, but it does have to have a high level justification for why it needed.",
